# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Document Management System — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─── Core Application ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
MONGO_URI=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/driveDB
PORT=3000
JWT_SECRET=mysupersecretkey123
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=90d
JWT_COOKIE_EXPIRES_IN=90
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key

# ─── SMTP (Outbound Email — used for notifications) ──────────────────────────
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=your-app-password

# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# EMAIL INGESTION MODULE
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─── Email Provider ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Which email ingestion mode to use. Set to "imap" or "gmail".
# Leave empty or unset to completely disable email ingestion.
EMAIL_PROVIDER=

# ─── IMAP Settings (required when EMAIL_PROVIDER=imap) ────────────────────────
# IMAP server hostname (e.g. imap.gmail.com, outlook.office365.com)
IMAP_HOST=imap.gmail.com

# IMAP server port (993 for TLS, 143 for plaintext — avoid plaintext in production)
IMAP_PORT=993

# Email address / username for IMAP authentication
IMAP_USER=your-inbox@gmail.com

# Password or app-specific password for IMAP authentication
# For Gmail: Generate at https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# For Outlook: Use your account password with "Allow less secure apps" or app passwords
# SECURITY: Never commit real credentials. Use environment injection in production.
IMAP_PASSWORD=your-app-password

# Whether to use TLS/SSL for the IMAP connection (true/false, default: true)
IMAP_TLS=true

# Which mailbox folder to monitor (default: INBOX)
IMAP_FOLDER=INBOX

# ─── Gmail API Settings (required when EMAIL_PROVIDER=gmail) ──────────────────
# OAuth2 Client ID from Google Cloud Console
# Create at: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
GMAIL_CLIENT_ID=

# OAuth2 Client Secret from Google Cloud Console
GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET=

# OAuth2 Redirect URI (must match the one configured in GCP Console)
GMAIL_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:3000/auth/gmail/callback

# OAuth2 Refresh Token — obtained via the OAuth2 consent flow
# Use the helper script or Google OAuth2 Playground to generate this.
# See EMAIL_INGESTION_README.md for step-by-step instructions.
GMAIL_REFRESH_TOKEN=

# Gmail user to impersonate. Use "me" for the authenticated user's own inbox.
GMAIL_USER_EMAIL=me

# ─── Shared Email Ingestion Settings ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Comma-separated list of allowed file extensions (without dots, lowercase)
# Only attachments matching these types will be ingested; others are skipped.
EMAIL_ALLOWED_TYPES=pdf,docx,doc,png,jpg,jpeg,xlsx,xls,csv,txt

# Maximum attachment size in megabytes. Attachments exceeding this are skipped.
EMAIL_MAX_ATTACHMENT_SIZE_MB=20

# Number of emails to process per batch on initial backlog sync.
# Prevents overwhelming the system if the inbox has thousands of unread emails.
EMAIL_BATCH_SIZE=10

# Polling interval in milliseconds (used by Gmail API mode).
# IMAP mode uses IDLE for real-time notifications and doesn't need polling.
EMAIL_POLL_INTERVAL_MS=60000

# Number of days to keep processed email records before auto-deleting via TTL.
# After this period, records are cleaned up. If the same email were somehow
# re-fetched, it would be re-ingested (unlikely with proper \Seen flags).
EMAIL_PROCESSED_TTL_DAYS=90

# Username and email for the system bot user that owns email-ingested documents.
# This user is auto-created on first run if it doesn't exist.
EMAIL_BOT_USERNAME=email-bot
EMAIL_BOT_EMAIL=email-bot@system.local

# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# WORKFLOW ENGINE (Routing + Approval + Escalation)
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─── Redis Connection (required for BullMQ job queues) ────────────────────────
# If REDIS_HOST is not set, the workflow engine workers will NOT start.
# The rest of the app (Express server, MongoDB) will work normally without Redis.
REDIS_HOST=127.0.0.1
REDIS_PORT=6379
REDIS_PASSWORD=

# ─── Escalation SLA ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Time in milliseconds before an unactioned approval step is automatically
# escalated to the next person in the chain. Default: 172800000 (48 hours).
# For testing, you can set this to a short value like 60000 (1 minute).
ESCALATION_SLA_MS=172800000
